graph TD
    %% Entry Point
    User((User)) -->|submits request| MCP[MCP Tools: mcp_server.py]
    
    %% Triage Phase
    MCP -->|routes request| Triage[Tier Triage: router.py]
    Triage -->|loads profile| Config[Tier Profiles: config.py]
    Triage -->|maps route| Graph[Route Graph: graph.json]
    
    %% Execution Phase
    MCP -->|requests execution| Executor[Brain Executor: executor.py]
    
    Executor -->|dispatches L1| L1[L1 Surgical Read: executor.py]
    Executor -->|dispatches L2| L2[L2 Dependency Trace: executor.py]
    Executor -->|dispatches L3| L3[L3 Analysis: executor.py]
    Executor -->|dispatches L4| L4[L4 Synthesis: executor.py]
    Executor -->|dispatches L5| L5[L5 Critique: executor.py]
    
    %% Tier Specifics
    L1 -->|uses| Graphify[Graphify Pipeline]
    L2 -->|traces| Deps[Dependency Map]
    L3 -->|uses| Stack[Analytics Stack: Polars/DuckDB]
    L4 -->|initializes| Swarm[ruflo Swarm]
    L4 -->|creates| Manager[DeepAgent Manager]
    L5 -->|baseline| L4
    L5 -->|performs| Review[Adversarial Review]
    
    %% Guardrail Phase
    L1 & L2 & L3 & L4 & L5 -->|verifies output| Sovereign[Sovereign Validator: sovereign.py]
    Sovereign -->|loads constraints| State[Sovereign State: sovereign_state.md]
    
    %% Feedback Loop
    Sovereign -->|if False: loopback| Executor
    
    %% Final Delivery
    Sovereign -->|if True| Semantic[Surgical Semantic Layer]
    Semantic -->|translates output| Result((Final Result))
    Result --> User
